## Session: Centralized Config Defaults & Cross-Backend Parity

### Date

- 2026-05-16

### Intent

- Achieve 100% Kafka parity for `DescribeConfigs` by centralizing all 22 topic
  config defaults in a shared service-layer module.
- Fix cross-backend divergence where PG and limbo returned empty configs.
- Expand `IncrementalAlterConfigs` allowlist to accept all standard keys.
- Fix `ErrorCode::None` returned for non-existent topics.

### Files Touched

- `jansu-storage/src/service/topic_config_defaults.rs` [NEW]
- `jansu-storage/src/service.rs`
- `jansu-storage/src/service/describe_configs.rs`
- `jansu-storage/src/dynostore/mod.rs`
- `jansu-storage/src/dynostore/describe.rs`
- `jansu-storage/src/slate/storage_topic_metadata.rs`
- `jansu-broker/tests/describe_configs.rs`
- `jansu-storage/tests/describe_configs.rs`
- `FEATURE_GAPS.md`
- `docs/VE0X_NATIVE_FEATURE_REQUEST.md`
- `tips/phases/09-topic-config-admin.md`

### Tests Added

- `describe_configs::in_memory::single_topic` — validates 22 defaults, filtering, synonyms
- `describe_configs::in_memory::alter_single_topic` — alter/delete lifecycle
- `describe_configs::lite::{single_topic,alter_single_topic}`
- `describe_configs::slatedb::{single_topic,alter_single_topic}`
- `topic_config_defaults::tests::{defaults_contain_cleanup_policy_and_retention_ms, synonyms_for_known_configs, defaults_are_ordered_by_name}`

### Verification Commands

- `cargo test -p jansu-broker --test describe_configs --no-default-features --features dynostore` ✅
- `cargo test -p jansu-broker --test describe_configs --no-default-features --features slatedb` ✅
- `cargo test -p jansu-broker --test describe_configs --no-default-features --features redlinedb` ✅
- `cargo test -p jansu-storage --test describe_configs --no-default-features --features dynostore` ✅

### Outcomes

- All 4 backends return identical 22-config default sets via service-layer merging.
- Synonym expansion covers all 22 configs with broker-level alias names.
- Key filtering works identically across all backends.
- `IncrementalAlterConfigs` accepts all 22 standard Kafka topic config keys.
- Non-existent topics return `UnknownTopicOrPartition` instead of `ErrorCode::None`.

### Residual Risks

- PG backend not tested (requires POSTGRES_URL).
- Config enforcement deferred to Phase 13 and owning phases.
- Kafka returns ~50 configs; 22 high-priority implemented.

